 2+++ 60D3              ; UINT32 values are little-endian. Carry set means overflow or end > capacity.
 3+++ 60D3              ; Zero-length ranges are valid when offset <= capacity.
 4+++ 60D3              ; Non-reentrant: each processor serializes memory API calls.
